{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for ml/data/validation/annotations.json. Copy it there, delete this",
    "_comment key, and replace the entries with your own clips.",
    "Times are seconds from the start of the clip. See README.md in this directory.",
    "",
    "`direction` (forward|backward|sideways) and `speed` (slow|fast) are optional but",
    "strongly wanted: without them recall cannot be split by fall type, and a detector",
    "that is far worse at backward falls looks identical to one that is not.",
    "",
    "`conditions` is optional and keyed by lighting, camera_angle, distance, occlusion,",
    "resolution. Values are free text. Without at least two distinct values on a",
    "dimension there is nothing to compare across, so the per-condition table stays empty."
  ],

